# Vegetable Tortilla Stew

Based on [Chrissy Teigen Cravings](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251202235345/https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/)), pg. ???

{ rating="5" image="vegetable_tortilla_stew.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Stew

- [ ] 2 Tbsp [vegetable oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" }
- [ ] 1 [onion]{ ing="onion" }, diced
- [ ] 1 [green bell pepper]{ ing="green-bell-pepper" }, diced
- [ ] 1 [jalapeño pepper]{ ing="jalapeno-pepper" }, finely diced (include seeds)
- [ ] 4 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 2 tsp [chili powder]{ ing="chili-powder" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [ground cumin]{ ing="ground-cumin" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [cayenne pepper]{ ing="cayenne-pepper" }
- [ ] 2 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [pepper]{ ing="pepper" }
- [ ] 4 cups [vegetable]{ ing="vegetable" } (or chicken) broth
- [ ] 2 (15 oz) cans [diced tomatoes]{ ing="diced-tomatoes" }
- [ ] 2 (15 oz) cans [black beans]{ ing="black-beans" }, drained and rinsed
- [ ] 1 cup _cooked_ [rice]{ ing="rice" }

### Garnish

- [ ] fresh [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }, roughly chopped
- [ ] 1 [avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, sliced
- [ ] [crumbled cortija]{ ing="crumbled-cortija" } (or shredded cheddar cheese)
- [ ] (See cookbook for recipe of tortilla strippies, optional or use toasted bread)

## Recipe

1. Prep the [vegetables]{ ing="vegetable" } and collect seasonings
1. In the dutch oven, heat the [oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" } over medium heat until shimmering
1. Add the [onion]{ ing="onion" }, [bell pepper]{ ing="green-bell-pepper" }, and [jalapeño]{ ing="jalapeno-pepper" }
1. Add the [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, [chili powder]{ ing="chili-powder" }, [cumin]{ ing="ground-cumin" }, [cayenne]{ ing="cayenne-pepper" }, [salt]{ ing="salt" }, and [pepper]{ ing="pepper" } (~2 min)
1. Add the chicken broth, [tomatoes]{ ing="diced-tomatoes" }, and [beans]{ ing="black-beans" }
1. Bring to a boil then reduce heat and simmer for 30 min
1. Add the [rice]{ ing="rice" } and cook until nice and thick (~15 min)
1. Season to taste with additional salt and pepper
1. Serve the soup garnished with [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }, [avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, cheese, and the tortilla strippies or side bread
